WEBVTT

00:12:58.254 --> 00:13:00.700
mara nyingi unakua unalenga
mahitaji yako mwenyewe.

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:03.856
Lakini shukrani inakufanya
utake kuilipa mbeleni.

00:13:03.898 --> 00:13:06.434
Na nimepitia hii binafsi.

00:13:06.484 --> 00:13:08.240
Yani, mimi sio Mama Teresa,

00:13:08.310 --> 00:13:11.716
mimi bado ni mwanaharamu mchoyo
mara nyingi sana.

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:15.426
Lakini ni bora kuliko nilivyokua
kabla ya mradi huu.

00:13:15.584 --> 00:13:18.420
Na hii na kwa sababu ilinifanya nifahamu

00:13:18.494 --> 00:13:21.940
kuhusu utumiaji wa mlolongo wa usambazaji.

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:25.490
Ikanikumbusha kua
ninachokichukulia poa

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:28.426
hakipatikani kwa mamilioni
ya watu duniani.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:30.156
Kama maji.